# 统一换行处理：仓库内存 LF，检出时按平台转换。
# 不加这段的话，Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会让每次克隆都出现整文件 diff。
* text=auto

# 文本文件显式声明
*.c         text
*.cc        text
*.cpp       text
*.h         text
*.hpp       text
*.py        text
*.md        text
*.txt       text
*.ts        text
*.json      text
*.cmake     text
CMakeLists.txt text
NOTICE      text
LICENSE     text

# 脚本按平台固定换行：批处理必须 CRLF，shell 必须 LF
*.bat       text eol=crlf
*.cmd       text eol=crlf
*.sh        text eol=lf

# 二进制资源，禁止任何换行或编码转换
*.png       binary
*.ico       binary
*.icns      binary
*.jpg       binary
*.jpeg      binary
*.bmp       binary
*.gif       binary
*.webp      binary
*.exe       binary
*.dll       binary
*.lib       binary
*.qm        binary
